You are an expert full-stack software engineer, system architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, WebRTC engineer, payment integration specialist, and application security engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, modern, secure, responsive English learning platform named **SpeakMate**.

This application combines:

1. PRACTICE — English speaking with other members.
2. LEARN — English courses and mentor-led classes.
